  speakerName: "PH\xD3 L\xDD"
  title: "Tham quan l\xE0ng"
  content: "Tr\u01B0\u1EDBc ti\xEAn, h\xE3y \u0111\u1EC3 t\xF4i ch\u1EC9 cho c\u1EADu
    nh\u1EEFng g\xEC ch\xFAng ta \u0111ang c\xF3: khu d\xE2n c\u01B0 n\u01A1i m\u1ECDi
    ng\u01B0\u1EDDi sinh s\u1ED1ng, kho ch\u1EE9a gi\u1EEF l\u1EA1i t\u1EEBng h\u1EA1t
    l\xFAa, v\xE0 ph\xEDa xa l\xE0 tuy\u1EBFn ph\xF2ng th\u1EE7 \u2014 ranh gi\u1EDBi
    cu\u1ED1i c\xF9ng gi\u1EEFa l\xE0ng v\xE0 hi\u1EC3m nguy."
